Anasūyā embraces Sītā and praises sweet tale --- Anasūyā notes sunset birds bathing sages smoke trees deer moon --- Anasūyā bids adorned Sītā return to Rāma --- Adorned Sītā bows and goes to Rāma --- Rāma rejoices as Sītā reports love gift --- Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa marvel at rare human honor --- Rāma passes night honored by ascetics --- Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa ask leave after morning rites --- Ascetics warn forest beset and show fruit path --- Rāma with wife and Lakṣmaṇa enters forest like sun in clouds